<translate>
==== VehicleType ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Indicates what type of car this item will fit (Vehicle part). Values: 1 - Standard, 2 - Heavy Duty, 3 - Sport
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
VehicleType = 2,
</syntaxhighlight>
